918216" data-id="1668438918216"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1668585020941" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1668585020941"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Our Coffee</h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1668585020861" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1668585020861"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Everything is roasted in-house and to-order. We never have old coffee sitting around waiting to be sold. We roast it when you order it and we pride ourselves on continuously learning about our customers and our industry so we can be the best at what we do to serve you better. This process & practice allows us to give you an amazing coffee experience every time!&nbsp; In a sea of coffee options, you chose us so we want to show our appreciation by providing an excellent product.</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1668585020834" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1668585020834"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Clean + Effective + Safe</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1668585020856" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1668585020856" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1668439910960" data-id="16